# Intentionally committed demo "secrets" for teaching purposes.
# These are non-provider placeholder values that match our **custom**
# secret-scanning patterns (see ../.github/secret_scanning.yml),
# NOT the built-in provider patterns. That way this file can be
# committed, while the live push-protection demo (slide 13) uses a
# throwaway branch where a real-looking provider token is pasted and
# blocked by GitHub.

